 * @remarks
 * The widget is a separate top-level browsing context running on
 * `onramp.arc.io`. It communicates with the embedding host strictly
 * through `postMessage`, never via shared globals. The envelope below
 * is the only wire contract that exists between the two.
 *
 * Two-tier vocabulary:
 *
 * - `event` (one of {@link ONRAMP_EVENT_TYPES}) describes the
 *   host-visible **effect**.
 * - `code` (one of {@link ONRAMP_EVENT_CODES}) describes the
 *   **cause** or sub-type. Each event maps to a closed set of valid
 *   codes — see the per-schema definitions below.
